# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# stock-analysis-agent — environment template.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values:  cp .env.example .env
# `.env` is git-ignored; `.env.example` is committed. Real env vars override .env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Agent 3 (decision) — REQUIRED ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The only real API key the project needs. Used by the google-genai SDK in
# app/graph.py for the Buy/Sell/Hold synthesis call.
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# GOOGLE_API_KEY is also accepted if you already use that name.

# Optional Agent 3 tuning (safe to leave commented — these are the defaults):
# DECISION_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# DECISION_MAX_TOKENS=10000
# DECISION_CRITIC_PASSES=0        # extra "audit your draft" round-trips (0–2)

# ── Agent 2.5 (news) — recommended ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Dated headlines for Agent 3's catalyst timeline. Free key at https://tavily.com
# Without it, the news node no-ops and Agent 3 states no catalysts were available.
TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# NEWS_MAX_RESULTS=8
# NEWS_LOOKBACK_DAYS=180

# ── Agent 2 (fundamental) — recommended ──────────────────────────────────────
# NOT an API key. SEC EDGAR returns HTTP 403 unless the User-Agent carries a
# contact email. Put your own address here.
SEC_EDGAR_USER_AGENT=your-email@example.com stock-analysis-agent
# SEC_EDGAR_TIMEOUT=20

# ── Agent 1 (quantitative) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# yfinance needs no key or configuration.
